OL,3,GNEWSAStadium moves closer as legal
OL,4,Achallenge rebuffed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe High Court has dismissed a request
OL,7,Ffor a judicial review by campaigners
OL,8,Fopposed to Oxford United's proposal for
OL,9,Fa new 16,000-seater stadium.
OL,11,FThe club's plans to build on land known
OL,12,Fas the Triangle, near Kidlington, were
OL,13,Ffirst approved by Cherwell District
OL,14,FCouncil and then by the government last
OL,15,Fyear.
OL,17,FThey are opposed by campaign group
OL,18,FFriends of Stratfield Brake (FoSB),
OL,19,Fwhich attempted to challenge their
OL,20,Fapproval in the courts.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
