OL,3,GNEWSAStadium moves closer as legal
OL,4,Achallenge rebuffed
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut at a permission hearing at the High
OL,7,FCourt on Thursday its request for a
OL,8,Ffull judicial review was denied for the
OL,9,Fsecond time.
